{title: I'VE BEEN WORKING ON THE RAILROAD}
{subtitle: Traditional}
This old standard has many versions.  The "childrens" version usually ends with the first "Fee, fie, fiddly-i-o" verse.  The ballad version continues with the verses that follow.

